requirements.text:
Usability of the digital health application shall be tested
against the intended user group prior to listing application;
results documented.

Two methods: (1) Expert determination that the risk is very small;
(2) Safe Harbor, removal of 18 enumerated identifiers + no
actual knowledge that residual information could re-identify.

requirements.overview:
Whistleblower protections are legal framing. No software role;
the disclosing person's audit-trail evidence under their access
may be cited in subsequent proceedings.

requirements.text:
Records shall be established and maintained to provide evidence of
conformity to requirements and effective operation of the QMS;
shall remain legible, readily identifiable + retrievable.

Clinical investigations on devices shall be designed and conducted
to ensure rights, safety, dignity and well-being of subjects;
data shall be reliable and robust.
